  "description": "<p>Discover our beautiful collection of <a title=\"Birch &amp; Wilde brand products\" href=\"https://www.birchandwilde.co.uk/collections/wellbeing-products\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">wellbeing and nutrition</a> products and earn 15% on affiliate referrals from day one. Our best-seller is a Marine Collagen supplement (with clinical support and amazing reviews!) that is stocked in Superdrug.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We also have supplement products that hare renowned for helping with sleep, stress, immunity, energy &amp; fatigue, peri/menopause, urinary tract infections and gut health.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Besides this we stock a lovely array of partner brands - from <a title=\"Discover our Health &amp; wellness Tea Collections\" href=\"https://www.birchandwilde.co.uk/collections/tea-vitamin-teas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vitamin Teas</a> and <a title=\"Take a look at the health snacks we stock\" href=\"https://www.birchandwilde.co.uk/collections/treats-snacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Protein Bars &amp; Healthy Snacks</a>, to Collagen Facial Sheet Masks and beautiful Mindfulness Journals, from well known brands like <a title=\"View all BeautyPro Skincare products\" href=\"https://www.birchandwilde.co.uk/collections/beautypro-marine-collagen-sheet-masks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BeautyPro</a> and <a title=\"Discover the LSW London Mindfulness range\" href=\"https://www.birchandwilde.co.uk/collections/lsw-london\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LSW London</a>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>You can opt to be paid each month in cash by bank transfer or PayPal, or in coupons (equivalent GBP value) for use buying <strong>any product</strong> on our website.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All product information needed can easily be provided. Just drop us a message. We are a welcoming and friendly gang who are passionate about wellbeing from the inside out!</p>\r\n<p>Get special offers and free gifts regularly!&nbsp;</p>",
